<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  folio-assistant — Ingestion subprocess — extract structure.

  Source of truth: this file. Open it in bpmn.io, Camunda Modeler, or any other
  BPMN 2.0 tool. The SVG under docs/assets/img/workflows/ is generated from it
  by `bun run render:bpmn` — never hand-edit the SVG.

  The <folio:skill> extension on an activity names the folio-assistant skill
  that implements it; <folio:bean> marks a step that reads or writes the shared
  work plan in beans/.
-->
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:folio="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/bpmn"
                  id="Definitions_ExtractStructure"
                  targetNamespace="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/workflows"
                  exporter="folio-assistant" exporterVersion="1">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_ExtractStructure">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_ExtractStructure" name="Ingestion subprocess — extract structure" processRef="Process_ExtractStructure" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_ExtractStructure" name="Ingestion subprocess — extract structure" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>folio-assistant — Ingestion subprocess — extract structure.

  Source of truth: this file. Open it in bpmn.io, Camunda Modeler, or any other
  BPMN 2.0 tool. The SVG under docs/assets/img/workflows/ is generated from it
  by `bun run render:bpmn` — never hand-edit the SVG.

  The &lt;folio:skill&gt; extension on an activity names the folio-assistant skill
  that implements it; &lt;folio:bean&gt; marks a step that reads or writes the shared
  work plan in beans/.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <folio:policy enforcement="advisory" />
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="Process_ExtractStructure_LaneSet">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_0" name="Ingestion Engine (agent, runs unattended)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Two provenance paths converge on the same Task_Sections output — an embedded text layer extracted directly, or OCR that leaves the fuller text in ocr/ with only a stub in sections/ — and which branch this lane took is invisible downstream except to a grep that knows to check the fourth tier. Task_Candidates is the last step and it stays a proposal: theorems and definitions extracted here are never adjudicated verdicts, so nothing downstream may treat this lane's output as settled.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>StartEvent_Binary</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_HasText</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_ExtractText</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Ocr</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Sections</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Structure</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Candidates</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndEvent_Structured</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="StartEvent_Binary" name="Binary in hand">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_HasText" name="Embedded
text layer?">
      <bpmn:documentation>Does the binary carry an embedded text layer? `yes` extracts it; `no — scanned` runs OCR into ocr/page-*.txt.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e2</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_ExtractText" name="Extract the text layer">
      <bpmn:documentation>The document has a text layer: extract it with pdf-extract (pdfminer.six, then a zero-dependency content-stream reader). Exit 2 means no text layer — a scan — and routes to OCR; it is not an empty document.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <folio:skill ref="document-intake" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Ocr" name="OCR to ocr/page-*.txt">
      <bpmn:documentation>A document ingested this way keeps its text in ocr/ and only a stub in sections/, which the documented sections/ grep cannot see. That asymmetry is why the corpus-grep checklist has a fourth tier.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <folio:skill ref="document-intake" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Sections" name="Split into sections/*.md
with doc_brief front-matter">
      <bpmn:documentation>Contextual retrieval: a chunk in isolation loses what makes it mean anything, so each section carries the document brief.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <folio:skill ref="document-intake" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Structure" name="Write structure.json
(TOC, page ranges, metadata)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Write structure.json (pdf-structure/v1): doc id, TOC from the PDF outline or inferred from headings, page ranges, metadata, and source{} with the sha256 and a mimetype sniffed from the bytes, never the extension. A structure that could not be determined says so in structure_note rather than being rendered as one.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <folio:skill ref="document-intake" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Candidates" name="Extract claim candidates">
      <bpmn:documentation>candidates.json holds extracted theorems and definitions. Proposals only -- never adjudicated verdicts.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <folio:skill ref="document-intake" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_e8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndEvent_Structured" name="Structured">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_e8</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e1" sourceRef="StartEvent_Binary" targetRef="Gateway_HasText" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e2" name="yes" sourceRef="Gateway_HasText" targetRef="Task_ExtractText" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e3" name="no — scanned" sourceRef="Gateway_HasText" targetRef="Task_Ocr" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e4" sourceRef="Task_ExtractText" targetRef="Task_Sections" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e5" sourceRef="Task_Ocr" targetRef="Task_Sections" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e6" sourceRef="Task_Sections" targetRef="Task_Structure" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e7" sourceRef="Task_Structure" targetRef="Task_Candidates" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_e8" sourceRef="Task_Candidates" targetRef="EndEvent_Structured" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_ExtractStructure">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_ExtractStructure" bpmnElement="Collaboration_ExtractStructure">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Participant_ExtractStructure_di" bpmnElement="Participant_ExtractStructure" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1450" height="180" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_0_di" bpmnElement="Lane_0" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="190" y="80" width="1420" height="180" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="StartEvent_Binary_di" bpmnElement="StartEvent_Binary"><dc:Bounds x="277" y="152" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gateway_HasText_di" bpmnElement="Gateway_HasText"><dc:Bounds x="460" y="145" width="50" height="50" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_ExtractText_di" bpmnElement="Task_ExtractText"><dc:Bounds x="600" y="75" width="150" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Ocr_di" bpmnElement="Task_Ocr"><dc:Bounds x="600" y="185" width="150" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Sections_di" bpmnElement="Task_Sections"><dc:Bounds x="790" y="130" width="150" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Structure_di" bpmnElement="Task_Structure"><dc:Bounds x="980" y="130" width="150" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Candidates_di" bpmnElement="Task_Candidates"><dc:Bounds x="1170" y="130" width="150" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="EndEvent_Structured_di" bpmnElement="EndEvent_Structured"><dc:Bounds x="1417" y="152" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e1"><di:waypoint x="313" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="460" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e2"><di:waypoint x="510" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="570" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="570" y="115" /><di:waypoint x="600" y="115" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e3"><di:waypoint x="510" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="570" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="570" y="225" /><di:waypoint x="600" y="225" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e4"><di:waypoint x="750" y="115" /><di:waypoint x="760" y="115" /><di:waypoint x="760" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="790" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e5"><di:waypoint x="750" y="225" /><di:waypoint x="760" y="225" /><di:waypoint x="760" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="790" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e6"><di:waypoint x="940" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="980" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e7"><di:waypoint x="1130" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="1170" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_e8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_e8"><di:waypoint x="1320" y="170" /><di:waypoint x="1417" y="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
